  "reasoning": "From the standalone P&L, Revenue from Operations (total) was \u20b915,815.07 million (FY2021) and \u20b917,070.80 million (FY2022), giving a revenue YoY growth rate of approximately 7.94%. Net Income (PAT) was \u20b9210.83 million (FY2021) and \u20b9286.11 million (FY2022), giving a PAT YoY growth rate of approximately 35.71%. Converting to INR Crores (dividing by 10): FY2022 Revenue = 1707.08 Cr, FY2022 PAT = 28.61 Cr. These FY2022 growth rates (7.94% for revenue, 35.71% for PAT) are applied as primary projection assumptions for FY2023\u20132025. Shares outstanding for Skipper Limited are approximately 10.22 crore shares (as commonly reported), used to compute EPS."
